{"code":"E4","wikidata":"Q4924120","wikipedia":{"en":"Asok BTS station","th":"สถานีอโศก"},"summary":{"en":"Asok station is a BTS Skytrain station on the Sukhumvit Line in Watthana and Khlong Toei Districts, Bangkok, Thailand. The station is located on Sukhumvit Road at Asok Montri Intersection, with an interchange to MRT Blue Line at Sukhumvit station. Around the station, there are many hotels and facilities for foreign tourists and business people.","th":"สถานีอโศก เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนสุขุมวิทบริเวณทางแยกอโศกมนตรี ในพื้นที่เขตวัฒนาและเขตคลองเตย กรุงเทพมหานคร เป็นจุดเชื่อมต่อรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายเฉลิมรัชมงคลที่สถานีสุขุมวิท"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Train_leaving_Asok_Station.jpg/960px-Train_leaving_Asok_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Train_leaving_Asok_Station.jpg","author":"No machine-readable author provided. Cdha~commonswiki assumed (based on copyrigh","license":"Public domain"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Asok_BTS_station_20251228_132032.jpg/960px-Asok_BTS_station_20251228_132032.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Asok_BTS_station_20251228_132032.jpg","author":"Jothefiredragon","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/ASOK_SKYTRAIN_STATION_SUKHUMVIT_ROAD_BANGKOK_THAILAND_JAN_2012_%287021924885%29.jpg/960px-ASOK_SKYTRAIN_STATION_SUKHUMVIT_ROAD_BANGKOK_THAILAND_JAN_2012_%287021924885%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ASOK_SKYTRAIN_STATION_SUKHUMVIT_ROAD_BANGKOK_THAILAND_JAN_2012_(7021924885).jpg","author":"calflier001","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0"},{"thumb":"htt